# PFDD Data Collection Plan

## Objective

Collect a small custom dataset for evaluating fall detection models in real-world conditions.

## Participants

- 5 participants

## Activities

### Normal Activities

- Walking
- Standing
- Sitting
- Lying down

### Fall Activities

- Fall forward
- Fall backward
- Fall left
- Fall right

## Camera Angles

- Front view (0°)
- Diagonal view (45°)
- Side view (90°)

## Environment

### Indoor

- Classroom
- Dormitory room

### Outdoor

- School yard

## Lighting Conditions

- Daytime
- Nighttime

## Recording Device

- Smartphone camera
- IP camera (if available)

## Expected Output

- Videos of fall and non-fall activities
- Frames extracted for future training and testing